#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is the third and final survey"
#~ " in the project, following the "
#~ "initial ones you completed before and"
#~ " after\n"
#~ "      soil sampling. The majority of "
#~ "questions are consistent with the "
#~ "previous surveys so that we can "
#~ "accurately\n"
#~ "      measure changes over time and "
#~ "understand the impact of project "
#~ "participation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Dit is de derde en laatste enquête"
#~ " in het project, na de eerste "
#~ "die u voor en na hebt afgerond."
#~ "\n"
#~ "bodembemonstering. Het merendeel van de "
#~ "vragen is in overeenstemming met de "
#~ "vorige enquêtes, zodat we nauwkeurig "
#~ "kunnen\n"
#~ "veranderingen in de tijd te meten "
#~ "en de impact van projectparticipatie te"
#~ " begrijpen."

